  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "よなかに　マシェードのすむ　もりに\nいくのは　きけん。　あやしいひかりに\nまどわされ　にどと　かえれなくなる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "한밤중에 마셰이드가 사는 숲에\n가는 것은 위험하다. 이상한빛에\n유인되어 다시는 돌아올 수 없게 된다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "深夜前往燈罩夜菇棲息的森林\n是很危險的。會被怪異的光線\n迷惑，從此再也回不來。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il est risqué de s’aventurer la nuit dans un bois\npeuplé de Lampignon. Attirés par leur lumière\nenvoûtante, certains n’en sont jamais revenus.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nachts sollte man Wälder meiden, in denen\nLamellux leben. Ihr unheimliches Licht raubt\njedem die Orientierung.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es peligroso adentrarse por la noche en un\nbosque habitado por Shiinotic. Su luz confunde\na los caminantes, que terminan perdiéndose.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Meglio non avventurarsi di notte in un bosco\nabitato da questi Pokémon, perché le loro luci\nfanno perdere il senso dell’orientamento.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Forests where Shiinotic live are treacherous to\nenter at night. People confused by its strange\nlights can never find their way home again.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "夜中に　マシェードの棲む　森に\nいくのは　危険。　怪しい光に\n惑わされ　二度と　帰れなくなる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "深夜前往灯罩夜菇栖息的森林\n是很危险的。会被怪异的光线\n诱惑，再也回不来了。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es peligroso adentrarse por la noche en un\nbosque habitado por Shiinotic. Su luz confunde\na los caminantes, que terminan perdiéndose.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "てんめつする　ほうしを　ふきだし\nねむりに　いざなう。　ねむった\nえものの　せいきを　すいとる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "깜빡이는 포자를 뿜어내어\n잠으로 유도한다. 잠든\n먹이의 정기를 빨아들인다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會噴出閃爍的孢子讓獵物睡著，\n再從睡著的獵物身上吸取精氣。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il projette des spores clignotantes qui\nhypnotisent et endorment ses proies,\navant de venir absorber leur énergie vitale.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Speit blinkende Sporen, die eine einschläfernde\nWirkung haben. Schläft die Beute ein, wird ihr\ndie Lebenskraft ausgesaugt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Las esporas parpadeantes que despide tienen\nun efecto somnífero. Absorbe la vitalidad de su\npresa cuando esta se queda dormida.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Libera spore soporifere che emettono una luce\nintermittente di cui si serve per addormentare\nle sue prede, a cui poi succhia l’energia vitale.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It emits flickering spores that cause drowsiness.\nWhen its prey succumb to sleep, this Pokémon\nfeeds on them by sucking in their energy.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "点滅する　胞子を　吹き出し\n眠りに　誘う。　眠った\n獲物の　精気を　吸い取る。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "喷出闪烁的孢子诱使对方睡眠。\n会吸取睡着了的猎物的精气。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Las esporas parpadeantes que despide tienen\nun efecto somnífero. Absorbe la vitalidad de su\npresa cuando esta se queda dormida.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "えものを　ねむらせ　うでの　さきから\nせいきを　うばう。　なかまが　よわると\nせいきを　おくって　たすけてあげる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "먹이를 잠들게 하고 팔 끝으로\n생기를 빼앗는다. 동료가 약해지면\n생기를 보내 도와준다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會讓獵物睡著，然後用手臂前端\n奪取獵物的精氣。在夥伴虛弱的時候，\n會輸送精氣過去拯救對方。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il endort ses victimes puis aspire leur énergie\nvitale avec ses doigts. Il aide ses congénères\naffaiblis en partageant cette énergie avec eux.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es lullt seine Gegner in den Schlaf und raubt\nihnen über seine Fingerspitzen die Lebenskraft.\nDiese schickt es schwächelnden Kameraden.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Duerme a su presa y le arrebata la vitalidad con\nsus brazos. Si otro Shiinotic se encuentra en\napuros, le transmite sus fuerzas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Addormenta la preda e utilizza le estremità delle\nsue braccia per rubarle l’energia vitale, che può\nanche trasmettere ai compagni in difficoltà.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It puts its prey to sleep and siphons off their\nvitality through the tip of its arms. If one of its\nkind is weakened, it helps by sending it vitality.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "獲物を　眠らせ　腕の　先から\n生気を　奪う。　仲間が　弱ると\n生気を　送って　助けてあげる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "让猎物睡着，然后从手腕处夺走\n对方的生命气息。伙伴虚弱的话，\n就会输送生命气息给予拯救。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Duerme a su presa y le arrebata la vitalidad con\nsus brazos. Si otro Shiinotic se encuentra en\napuros, le transmite sus fuerzas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "なわばりを　めぐり　パラセクトと\nあらそい　はじめると　あたりいちめん\nほうしまみれに　なってしまうぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "영역을 두고 파라섹트와\n싸움을 시작하면 부근 일대는\n포자투성이가 되어 버린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "一旦為了爭奪地盤而\n與派拉斯特展開鬥爭，\n周圍就會變得到處都是孢子。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quand un conflit territorial éclate entre Parasect\net lui, un brouillard de spores envahit toute\nla zone.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Kommt es zwischen ihm und Parasek zu\nRevierkämpfen, ist hinterher die gesamte\nUmgebung mit Sporen bedeckt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Al rondar por su territorio, si se encuentra con\nun Parasect, competirá con él y acabarán\ndejando el lugar cubierto de esporas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quando Shiinotic e Parasect lottano per\nil dominio di un territorio, finiscono per\ncoprire ogni cosa con le loro spore.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
